S certificate issued for node2 by the CA\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-68b4af524b0547d7\"],\"summary\":\"CSR signed by CA producing cert with CN=node2, SAN DNS:node2/IP:10.100.105.11\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 serves HTTPS on port 8443 with the issued certificate\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-26b7cf72ced644aa\",\"cmd-c4b697e01a0b488a\"],\"summary\":\"nginx configured and active with 8443 SSL vhost; curl to https://10.100.105.11:8443 returns HTTP 200 presenting CN=node2 cert issued by Fleet Internal CA\"},{\"requirement\":\"CA installed as trusted system CA on node1\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-0a4d3158aa184c25\"],\"summary\":\"update-ca-certificates added fleet-internal-ca.crt; openssl verify against system store returns OK for node2 cert\"},{\"requirement\":\"CA installed as trusted system CA on node2\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-2d3840cd5a9442d7\"],\"summary\":\"update-ca-certificates added fleet-internal-ca.crt on node2; openssl verify against system store returns OK\"},{\"requirement\":\"End-to-end trusted HTTPS verified without -k\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-46024a2aa4ed4a53\",\"cmd-bd7fd09f46b342d5\"],\"summary\":\"curl from node2 (self) and node1 to node2:8443 both show 'SSL certificate verify ok' and HTTP 200\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 pre-restart healthy baseline\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-6f25ae667eba4196\"],\"summary\":\"boot_id df9e2dce..., CA files present, openssl verify OK\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart acknowledgement returned before disconnect\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-f0bba40495504c31\"],\"summary\":\"backgrounded reboot command acknowledged 'reboot scheduled' before node disconnected\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 boot identity changed after restart\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-404b0e641fb24c11\",\"cmd-c531dec9e97c4a62\",\"cmd-c3b6ff6c454b4a27\"],\"summary\":\"boot_id changed from df9e2dce... to f5a84077..., with a connection-timeout during the reboot window as intermediate proof\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 post-restart recovered state\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-63b336d536